WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:04.708
- Dragging my ass out here on Christmas.
- [Kelce, Johnson singing:] Jawn we now our game day apparel!

00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:05.875
The disrespect.

00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:07.833
- Buddy! We gotta take an
MVP photo!

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:09.125
Go put on your jersey.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.625
- Let's make this quick. I'm on a minutes restriction...

00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:22.500
unless I decide I'm not.

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:24.000
- Whoa, fellas, I can't let-

00:00:24.458 --> 00:00:27.000
Classic... war on Christmas.

00:00:27.708 --> 00:00:29.208
- [into walkie:] We’re in.

00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:30.625
- What the hell was that?

00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:32.458
- Christmas is a basketball holiday.

00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:35.083
And for 17 years it's been a LeBron holiday.

00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:37.250
And we're gonna make sure it stays that way.

00:00:37.458 --> 00:00:39.375
- I just tried my first gingerbread
cookie person.

00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:40.500
America, man.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.250
- No, I'm only here for work.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.583
- Young king, are you cryin’?

00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:46.125
- YOUSE gotta problem?! ‘Cuz Christmas is an emotional time of year. 

00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:50.500
- Hmm, hmm. That’s not how coaches speak to players in MY league.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.208
- Lamar versus everybody.

00:00:53.208 --> 00:00:54.750
Just like old times.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.333
- KD, cut the feed. Football's going off the air...

00:00:57.458 --> 00:00:58.333
- Hang on.

00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:00.625
Some kid online is arguing with me about VORP.

00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:04.958
- [AD:] What's the matter?

00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:06.000
You don’t run anymore?

00:01:06.875 --> 00:01:08.208
AH, MY LEG!

00:01:08.333 --> 00:01:08.708
- Really?

00:01:08.958 --> 00:01:09.958
- AHHHHH!!

00:01:09.958 --> 00:01:12.250
- That's the WORST fall I've ever seen.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.833
- Please, step back. You're offside.

00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:15.000
- OH, NOW YOU TELL ME.

00:01:16.458 --> 00:01:17.458
- Christmas is mine.

00:01:17.458 --> 00:01:18.750
You can have January.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:19.708
- Do it, Lamar!

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:21.875
They’re basketball players. They’re cooler than you!

00:01:22.208 --> 00:01:23.958
- Yippee-Ki-Yay, Justin Tucker!

00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:26.458
Happy trails, Bron.

00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:27.708
- Lamar!

00:01:28.583 --> 00:01:31.208
- I knew you were gonna do thattttt...

00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:32.958
- Now let's celebrate Christmas
the right way:

00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:36.375
Ignoring our families by alternating
between football and basketball.

00:01:39.041 --> 00:01:42.291
- Do you really think you have a chance against us, Mr. Cowboy?

00:01:42.291 --> 00:01:43.416
- Cowboy?

00:01:43.416 --> 00:01:45.958
I was always kinda partial to the Ravens.

00:01:45.958 --> 00:01:48.166
- Oh, really? I'm a big Browns fan this week.

